# HarborGuard paired untuned base (C4 pretraining checks).
# Pair with harborguard-lora using the same base and GGUF quantization;
# preserve the same tokenizer chat template and temperature 0.2.
# Place the exported harborguard-base.gguf here, then run:
#   ollama create harborguard-base -f Modelfile.base
# Used as base in python -m ml.lora.eval on the same test set.
# Only the paired difference isolates tuning; qwen3:1.7b is a separate system baseline.
# Agent requests supply the system prompt, matching training.
FROM ./harborguard-base.gguf
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
